 2026-10-21 Package row alignment: align the icon and name/author/version/summary block at their top edges in catalog and installed lists. Override the more-specific catalog row centering rule and omit the icon top offset. Add Repository enters the synthetic Categories directly; the separate loading route is a fixed capture fixture. Stale Add links cannot change an existing installation; only the explicit Update route may replace its base fixture version with the refreshed catalog version.
 
 2026-10-21 verification scope correction: verify and capture only changed screens and the screens affected by a changed shared component. A wording-only edit needs the affected search field/screen, not every screen/device/locale/theme. Do not use the previous stop/build/restart/all-render integration routine for incremental UI edits: Viewer startup and watched-file reload both call renderAll. Stage changes and use a targeted capture route or focused browser verification. Broaden captures only for a concrete affected dependency or an explicitly requested full regression. This preference supersedes earlier exhaustive recapture instructions.
+
+2026-10-21 Sileo install queue (mock proposal, supersedes immediate Add): Get/追加 queues a Package id, selected version and operation without installing or enabling. Deduplicate by id; retain snapshot versions across catalog refresh and navigation. A bottom Queued count opens the Install sheet: remove individual items, Clear Queue, close retaining queue, then Confirm/インストール commits the batch. Initial installs are disabled. Empty and invalid queues cannot confirm. Confirm validates all entries and commits atomically; failure retains installed state and the queue for retry. During processing disable edits, dismissal and duplicate confirmation; show a short error or completion. Reinstall from installed Modify/管理 bottom action sheet queues the currently installed version and preserves its current enabled state on commit; a changed installed version makes that queued operation stale rather than downgrading. The action sheet also exposes existing Delete/削除 with its short confirmation and separate Cancel. Update remains explicit and retains existing enabled-state semantics. Never trigger install from a URL query: legacy Add/apply URLs on an uninstalled id are no-ops. No-demo installation state pages are fixed sample captures only. The shared queue bar and sheets are defined in the component catalog before composing fixtures. Keep 3 tabs, category origin, host-first details, explicit source navigation and JA/EN search wording. New queue/management work is a mock proposal only, not native adoption or runtime/network installation evidence. Capture only representative affected details and sheets.
